Copyright 2026 tts_eu_pt authors

This product includes software developed as part of the Kokoro project
(https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro, Apache-2.0) — the acoustic model code vendored under
tts_eu_pt/kokoro/. The model weights are fine-tuned from Kokoro-82M
(https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, Apache-2.0). The Kokoro architecture derives
from StyleTTS2 (https://github.com/yl4579/StyleTTS2, MIT).

European-Portuguese grapheme-to-phoneme conversion uses TugaPhone
(https://github.com/TigreGotico/tugaphone, Apache-2.0).

See ATTRIBUTIONS.md for the full list of components and licenses.
